# Build artifacts
build/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.out
*.log
*.pcap
*.csv
*.txt
# ...but CMake build files are source, not artifacts: the blanket *.txt rule
# above silently kept the dv-cl module's build system out of the repository,
# leaving the pushed module unbuildable for anyone who cloned it.
!CMakeLists.txt
!**/CMakeLists.txt
*.png
*.html
*.xml
*.pdf
*.pyc
__pycache__/

